cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Sovereign Vault"
message: >-
  If you use this software or refer to it in academic work, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Pedro Henrique Almeida Prado
    family-names: de Oliveira
    affiliation: >-
      Universidade de São Paulo, Instituto de Ciências Matemáticas e de
      Computação (ICMC)
repository-code: "https://github.com/pealmeida/sovereign-vault"
abstract: >-
  A Local-First architecture that mediates AI-agent access to local secrets and
  credentials. Combines an encrypted vault, an MCP (Model Context Protocol)
  gateway, capability scopes, consent modes, and tamper-evident auditing. The
  repository is the Design Science Research instantiation artifact of an MBA
  thesis on data sovereignty for personal AI agents.
keywords:
  - data sovereignty
  - local-first
  - model context protocol
  - privacy
  - rust
  - design science research
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
# TODO: adicionar `date-released` ao criar a primeira tag de release.
